01:37.200 --> 01:38.410
My name is Asami.

01:38.410 --> 01:41.330
I'm a 17-year-old high school girl.

01:41.330 --> 01:44.000
I keep it secret from everyone, but...

01:44.000 --> 01:46.330
I'm actually married.

01:47.790 --> 01:51.840
My husband, Ichimaru Kyousuke-sensei,
teaches at my school.

01:58.340 --> 02:00.090
What are you looking at, Mama?

02:00.090 --> 02:02.600
I'm doing some reconnaissance.

02:02.600 --> 02:04.350
"Reconnaissance"?

02:04.350 --> 02:08.850
I want understand Ichimaru-sensei better by investigating his surroundings.

02:09.230 --> 02:11.900
Mama, you still haven't
given up on him?

02:11.900 --> 02:17.320
You bet I haven't. Ichimaru-sensei
tickles my maternal instinct a little.

02:17.900 --> 02:20.490
I want to take care of him,
and stuff.

02:20.490 --> 02:24.580
Mama, you didn't catch
some bad disease again, did you?

02:26.500 --> 02:28.460
Ah, Darling-

02:30.330 --> 02:33.040
Ooh, that was TOO close.

02:33.040 --> 02:34.550
Why do <i>I</i> have to hide?

02:35.420 --> 02:36.510
Is something wrong?

02:36.510 --> 02:40.010
Oh, no. Darling, have a safe trip.

02:49.020 --> 02:50.650
Huh?

02:55.070 --> 02:56.650
M-Mama, look! Look!

02:57.820 --> 02:59.150
Have a safe trip.

03:00.360 --> 03:02.570
What's going on up in here?!

03:11.580 --> 03:13.290
Did we just see that?

03:13.630 --> 03:16.170
A-Asami-oneechan is...

03:18.090 --> 03:19.300
What should I do?

03:19.800 --> 03:22.680
Did they see what we did there?

03:23.680 --> 03:26.260
How can I fix this?

03:27.100 --> 03:31.980
Our Secret Revealed...!

03:32.350 --> 03:36.190
The two lights that reach the Earth...

03:36.190 --> 03:38.530
Did they really see us?

03:36.820 --> 03:40.860
...each departed from a quasar during different ages.

03:41.570 --> 03:45.370
If the wrong people find out about that,

03:46.620 --> 03:48.120
we could be...

03:49.250 --> 03:50.710
What's wrong, Asami?

03:51.960 --> 03:54.790
Are you okay? Or are you feeling ill?

03:54.790 --> 03:56.420
No, I'm fine.

03:56.420 --> 03:58.500
But you look so pale.

03:58.500 --> 04:01.130
I bet you were up late last night.

04:03.090 --> 04:04.720
Please keep quiet during class.

04:05.800 --> 04:07.180
Sorry.

04:13.350 --> 04:15.150
Are you really okay?

04:15.150 --> 04:17.940
Yeah, I'm fine. It's nothing.

04:17.940 --> 04:22.400
When it comes to worries, <i>ex</i>pression is a lot more helpful than <i>re</i>pression.

04:22.740 --> 04:26.410
Yep, yep. You can talk to us
whenever you have a problem.

04:26.780 --> 04:28.950
Yeah, thanks.

04:32.000 --> 04:34.580
But I wonder what was
going on this morning.

04:34.920 --> 04:36.500
Did they really kiss?

04:37.540 --> 04:41.460
Whatever that was, it wasn't
a normal kiss between normal siblings.

04:43.930 --> 04:46.010
Could those two be...

04:46.010 --> 04:49.470
...in a forbidden brother-sister relationship?

04:49.470 --> 04:50.770
Asami.

04:50.770 --> 04:52.060
Onii-chan.

04:52.060 --> 04:54.060
What's so "forbidden"?

04:56.310 --> 04:58.520
Nothing a kid has to know!

04:58.980 --> 05:01.980
Worrying about it won't get me anywhere.

05:02.240 --> 05:06.700
This leaves me no choice but
to launch a full frontal assault!

05:09.830 --> 05:11.240
Sasuke!

05:12.660 --> 05:13.960
What is it?

05:15.290 --> 05:17.330
Mama's battle dress!

05:17.330 --> 05:19.290
Can you zip me up in back?

05:19.630 --> 05:21.130
Sure thing!

05:26.010 --> 05:30.930
Great. Today's the day I shoot Ichimaru-sensei out of the sky.

05:34.480 --> 05:37.140
I really want to believe
that they didn't see.

05:38.190 --> 05:39.230
But...

05:40.230 --> 05:43.030
I'm fairly sure they saw us.

05:47.070 --> 05:50.910
Aah! "Forbidden" Asami-oneechan!

05:50.910 --> 05:52.330
Quiet!

05:53.740 --> 05:56.370
For-bid-den?

06:17.310 --> 06:18.640
Umm.

06:21.860 --> 06:24.150
No, you can go first.

06:24.480 --> 06:28.360
N-No, you first.
I don't really have anything to say...

06:28.360 --> 06:29.660
Honestly, me neither...

06:30.700 --> 06:34.120
I can't exactly ask<i> if she saw us kissing.</i>

06:34.580 --> 06:38.460
It's too awkward to ask
if she was kissing her brother.

06:38.460 --> 06:40.580
But I can't leave things like this.

06:40.580 --> 06:44.590
But, my future man is... "with" his little sister.

06:40.920 --> 06:42.630
What's wrong? Come a little closer!

06:47.590 --> 06:48.880
Umm.

06:52.180 --> 06:56.140
Hey, Asami-chan, this morning...

07:02.650 --> 07:03.900
What's the matter?

07:06.900 --> 07:08.070
Kuri!

07:08.070 --> 07:11.360
Hey! Get down here!

07:11.360 --> 07:12.570
Stupid!

07:12.570 --> 07:17.290
Isn't he too small to jump down safely from up all the way up there?

07:15.530 --> 07:17.290
This is awful...

07:20.250 --> 07:21.120
Kuri!

07:32.840 --> 07:34.640
Ah, Kuri!

07:40.430 --> 07:42.190
Thank goodness!

07:43.770 --> 07:46.980
Kuri, if anything happened to you,

07:46.980 --> 07:50.900
I just couldn't face Darling or get his forgiveness.

07:54.820 --> 07:56.030
What was that?

07:59.950 --> 08:01.500
"Darling"?

08:01.500 --> 08:04.670
Ah, n-no...

08:04.670 --> 08:07.710
W-Won't you come in for some dumplings (dango)?

08:11.760 --> 08:15.390
It sure is getting hotter and hotter these days... (dandan atsuku, etc.)

08:15.720 --> 08:19.180
D-Dance, u-umm...

08:20.390 --> 08:25.730
Da-Da-Da-Da-Da-Da-Da...

08:23.980 --> 08:25.730
I'm right, right?

08:26.110 --> 08:29.820
I'm pretty sure you just said "Darling."

08:34.160 --> 08:37.870
Ahh... By "Darling," do you mean...

08:38.450 --> 08:40.160
...S-Sensei?

08:51.260 --> 08:55.010
So you're a couple,
but you're keeping it on the down-low.

08:55.680 --> 08:59.310
Umm, this just HAS to remain a secret.

08:59.310 --> 09:02.100
If the school found out about this...

09:02.100 --> 09:05.100
Then naturally, Sensei would be... fired.

09:05.100 --> 09:06.520
Then naturally, Sensei would be... fired.

09:10.190 --> 09:13.990
I understand. I won't tell a single soul.

09:15.700 --> 09:18.280
Sasuke knows how
to keep a secret, too.

09:18.990 --> 09:20.870
Thank you very much.

09:20.870 --> 09:22.870
Setting that aside...

09:22.870 --> 09:25.960
Since Sensei is married...

09:25.960 --> 09:28.670
...I guess I don't
have a chance with him.

09:29.460 --> 09:30.920
Sakura-san...

09:32.710 --> 09:35.090
I'd better head home.

09:35.090 --> 09:37.590
It's almost time for work anyway.

09:38.140 --> 09:39.890
Sasuke, time to go.

09:39.890 --> 09:41.430
Okay!

09:44.930 --> 09:46.310
I'm home.

09:46.310 --> 09:49.190
Darling, I'm so sorry.

09:49.190 --> 09:51.190
W-What's wrong?

09:51.650 --> 09:54.320
I... I...

09:55.570 --> 09:57.240
So that's what happened.

09:57.240 --> 09:59.700
They saw us kissing this morning.

10:00.240 --> 10:02.160
I'm really sorry.

10:02.160 --> 10:03.700
It was bound to happen.

10:04.290 --> 10:08.710
But Sakura-san said
she'd keep it a secret too, right?

10:08.710 --> 10:10.250
Yeah...

10:10.250 --> 10:12.710
This kind of puts the "fortune" in "misfortune."

10:13.210 --> 10:15.590
We'll both have to be more careful.

10:15.590 --> 10:16.800
Yes.

10:18.470 --> 10:20.470
Is the bath ready?

10:20.470 --> 10:23.760
It's been a long day,
and I'm really tired.

10:23.760 --> 10:25.930
Yes, it's ready.

10:26.810 --> 10:27.940
Thanks.

10:38.950 --> 10:42.580
Looks like I'll have to start the
"good man search" all over again.

10:45.080 --> 10:48.040
Asami-oneechan sure is nice.

10:48.040 --> 10:52.420
I want to marry a girl like her someday.

10:55.590 --> 10:58.170
Why you simple-minded little boy...

10:58.170 --> 11:00.300
Mama, put me down!

10:59.260 --> 11:01.590
This calls for noogies!

10:59.880 --> 11:00.970
I'm off.

11:01.300 --> 11:02.760
Have a safe trip.

11:06.350 --> 11:07.560
Bye.

11:11.150 --> 11:12.610
Now then...

11:14.020 --> 11:17.530
Mama, I'm sorries!

11:16.530 --> 11:20.740
Darling, I'm completely ready to face...

11:20.740 --> 11:23.530
...whatever might come our way.

11:23.530 --> 11:28.160
So, please keep loving me,
forever and always.

11:34.920 --> 11:36.920
My name is Asami.

11:36.920 --> 11:39.170
I'm a 17-year-old high school girl.

11:39.720 --> 11:43.680
I keep it secret from everyone, but...

11:43.680 --> 11:46.260
I'm actually married.

11:46.720 --> 11:51.230
My husband, Ichimaru Kyousuke-sensei,
teaches at my school.

11:54.190 --> 11:55.440
I'm off.

11:55.440 --> 11:56.730
Have a safe trip.

12:02.240 --> 12:05.240
You two are getting along ever so well.

12:05.950 --> 12:07.450
Grandma.

12:09.160 --> 12:11.210
Eh? The one from Hiroshima?

12:11.540 --> 12:14.630
Ahh, you found the place, Grandma. How are you?

12:14.630 --> 12:20.420
As you can see, I have.
Your directions led me straight to it.

12:20.420 --> 12:22.220
Oh, this is my wife.

12:22.220 --> 12:23.300
I'm Asami.

12:23.300 --> 12:25.510
Pleased to meet you.

12:25.930 --> 12:29.520
Having such a lovely wife
must make you...

12:29.520 --> 12:32.060
...a very happy man, Kyousuke.

12:34.520 --> 12:36.860
A-Asami, a moment please.

12:38.730 --> 12:44.570
Actually, I kept it a secret from Grandma that you're in high school.

12:45.660 --> 12:48.530
I figured that she would object to our wedding.

12:49.490 --> 12:50.700
What am I to do?

12:51.160 --> 12:53.460
I can't let her see my school uniform.

12:53.790 --> 12:56.880
We'll have to trick her for the time being.

12:56.880 --> 12:58.000
No way...

12:58.000 --> 13:01.800
Kyousuke! If you don't hurry,
you're going to be late for school.

13:02.550 --> 13:03.760
Sorry.

13:03.760 --> 13:05.470
Well, I'm off.

13:07.970 --> 13:09.760
Geez, Darling.

13:10.140 --> 13:15.060
You Want a Great-Grandchild...!?

13:19.940 --> 13:21.110
Umm...

13:21.690 --> 13:24.820
Grandma, I've got to get to work.

13:24.820 --> 13:26.610
Oh, do take care.

13:27.360 --> 13:30.370
I'll be back before dark.

13:40.420 --> 13:43.550
It's nice that Grandma came to visit us.

13:43.550 --> 13:47.970
But will I have to keep changing clothes in the train station restroom?

13:47.970 --> 13:50.180
Asa... I mean, Onohara.

13:50.640 --> 13:52.930
"Science Lab"

13:54.640 --> 13:55.770
Darling?

13:55.770 --> 13:58.900
Grandma didn't realize you were going to school, right?

13:58.900 --> 14:00.690
No, I gave her the slip.

14:00.190 --> 14:02.320
Ah... thank goodness.

14:03.940 --> 14:06.610
Anyway, I'll come home early today.

14:06.610 --> 14:07.400
Okay.

14:07.400 --> 14:08.450
Later.

14:08.450 --> 14:09.570
Okay.

14:17.790 --> 14:18.620
I'm home.

14:19.670 --> 14:21.540
Welcome back.

14:21.540 --> 14:24.050
Grandma, allow me to do it.

14:24.050 --> 14:29.430
It's fine; please leave it to me.
This is why I'm here.

14:32.810 --> 14:33.810
I'm home.

14:35.640 --> 14:37.520
What an amazing feast.

14:39.770 --> 14:41.980
And these are...

14:41.980 --> 14:44.900
...my special stamina noodles.

14:45.570 --> 14:50.610
Specialty-cut tuna, nattou, turnips, yams, and okra.

14:50.610 --> 14:52.490
That's pretty intense.

14:53.410 --> 14:56.790
The sticky parts are especially effective.

14:57.330 --> 15:02.080
I had to take charge and give you
a shove in the right direction.

15:03.040 --> 15:04.420
You see...

15:04.420 --> 15:08.420
I just can't wait to see
my great-grandchild.

15:08.420 --> 15:09.800
"Great-grandchild"?

15:09.800 --> 15:12.140
In other words, your child.

15:13.180 --> 15:15.060
A-About that...

15:15.060 --> 15:18.430
Won't you two hurry up and make a child?

15:19.180 --> 15:24.480
Holding my great-grandchild would be
the final joy in my life.

15:26.820 --> 15:28.650
With that in mind,

15:28.650 --> 15:31.990
I'll be staying here
until you conceive a child.

15:31.990 --> 15:33.490
Eh!?

15:34.700 --> 15:36.870
Grandma poses a real problem.

15:37.660 --> 15:40.210
"Until we conceive a child," she says.

15:44.290 --> 15:48.630
I think we should tell her the truth.

15:49.130 --> 15:51.680
You'll be inconvenienced if we don't.

15:52.720 --> 15:54.340
Darling...

15:58.390 --> 16:02.560
Grandma... Actually, we have
something important to tell you.

16:02.560 --> 16:04.100
Something important?

16:04.860 --> 16:07.150
We're sorry we kept this a secret, but...

16:07.610 --> 16:10.360
The truth is, Asami...

16:11.530 --> 16:13.160
What about Asami-chan?

16:13.740 --> 16:17.160
Actually, well...

16:19.080 --> 16:20.330
In other words...

16:20.330 --> 16:22.210
Is that so!?

16:22.210 --> 16:22.790
What.

16:22.790 --> 16:25.540
There's one on the way,
isn't there? Congratulations!

16:25.540 --> 16:27.960
A baby: my great-grandchild...

16:27.960 --> 16:29.250
Eh!?!

16:29.250 --> 16:32.510
Yes! Congratulations!

16:32.510 --> 16:34.760
Thank the heavens.

16:34.760 --> 16:36.720
So, when are you due?

16:36.720 --> 16:38.890
U-Umm, it's not like...

16:39.350 --> 16:41.730
Hey, Asami! You there?

16:42.810 --> 16:44.350
Father?

16:46.730 --> 16:47.900
Hey, Asami.

16:48.270 --> 16:49.650
What's the matter?

16:49.650 --> 16:51.400
I bought a watermelon for you.

16:51.940 --> 16:55.990
Oh, you must be Asami-san's father.

16:55.990 --> 16:59.330
You've always been
taking care of Kyousuke.

16:59.950 --> 17:01.910
She's my husband's grandmother.

17:01.910 --> 17:05.210
You must be thrilled. Congratulations!

17:05.500 --> 17:06.960
T-That's not...

17:06.960 --> 17:08.960
About your grandchild.

17:08.960 --> 17:12.630
Asami-chan is having a baby.

17:27.560 --> 17:28.940
Father!

17:30.820 --> 17:31.780
Are you okay!?

17:31.780 --> 17:33.070
Father!

17:33.070 --> 17:35.740
Are you okay!? Father!

17:37.490 --> 17:38.700
Sorry.

17:39.070 --> 17:41.660
My grandmother got the wrong idea.

17:41.660 --> 17:43.950
I'm really sorry.

17:44.250 --> 17:48.960
I want to see my great-grandchild's face,
if even a day faster.

17:49.330 --> 17:53.590
Kyousuke's and Asami-chan's child
would surely be adorable, don't you think?

17:53.590 --> 17:56.220
I'm done with this subject.

17:56.220 --> 17:57.970
"This subject," you say?

17:58.300 --> 18:01.350
Don't you <i>want</i> a grandchild?

18:01.350 --> 18:05.730
Enough about this grandchild business! I'll never allow such a thing!

18:06.180 --> 18:07.440
Father.

18:07.440 --> 18:12.270
But whether you permit it or not, they're still a married couple.

18:12.270 --> 18:14.740
To get my approval, they agreed to this.

18:15.110 --> 18:18.820
As you can see,
this is a settled matter.

18:19.700 --> 18:21.410
A contract?

18:21.410 --> 18:25.580
They're contractually forbidden to "do anything."

18:25.580 --> 18:29.040
Not until Asami graduates from high school, at least.

18:29.710 --> 18:31.130
"High school"?

18:32.210 --> 18:34.130
I'm going home.

18:42.550 --> 18:45.600
You're a high school student?

18:48.850 --> 18:50.520
I see.

18:56.150 --> 18:57.740
Sorry.

19:01.700 --> 19:04.620
High school... still a child.

19:05.990 --> 19:08.080
Sorry, Grandma.

19:08.580 --> 19:11.540
It's my fault. When we got married,

19:11.540 --> 19:15.050
I failed to mention that
Asami was still in high school.

19:18.300 --> 19:19.510
Sorry.

19:21.970 --> 19:23.390
I am...

19:37.570 --> 19:39.530
...going to sleep.

19:40.280 --> 19:41.910
Grandma.

19:45.490 --> 19:48.950
Eh? They're not getting it on
until she gets out of high school?

19:48.950 --> 19:52.040
That means... Asami-oneechan is a virgin!

19:52.040 --> 19:55.790
Yeah! I'm not gonna
let this chance slip away!

19:57.590 --> 20:00.420
What are you thinking,
you perverted kid?

20:01.260 --> 20:04.470
They're married,
but not having sex...

20:04.470 --> 20:07.180
Clearly a complicated couple.

20:11.020 --> 20:14.600
Hey, Darling.
Please wake up, Darling.

20:16.270 --> 20:17.190
Your grandma has...

20:25.700 --> 20:28.830
Kyousuke, I'm returning to Hiroshima!

20:28.830 --> 20:32.500
I made breakfast, so please eat up.

20:32.500 --> 20:36.840
Asami-san, please take care of Kyousuke.

20:36.840 --> 20:41.420
I plan to live a long time,
until the day I can see my great-grandchild.

20:41.420 --> 20:43.970
I'm really looking forward to it.

